    <string name="changelog_title">What’s new in CarLauncher C %1$s</string>
    <string name="changelog_current">• YMusic now starts and plays in the background while the launcher stays visible.
• Larger YMusic player with album cover, title, artist, progress and time.
• Large Previous / Play-Pause / Next controls.
• Phone-Link tile removed; clock can open any selected app such as CarLink/ZLink.
• Red / Carbon design added.
• Hold the compass for 1.5 seconds to cycle through the designs.
• Guided first-start setup for location, media access and default Home launcher.
• Build and APK publishing workflow improved.</string>
